### Get OpenAPI document

GET https://localhost:7007/openapi/v1.json

### Get all customershttps://localhost:7131/
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### put Update a customer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/customers/{{customerJohnId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": "Tariq ",
  "Email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "PhoneNumber": "0797271355",
  "Vehicles": [
    {
      "vehicalId": "13c80914-41ad-4d46-b7bb-60f6c89ad01e",
      "make": "Honda",
      "model": "Civic",
      "year": 2000,
      "licensePlate": "XYZ456"
    },
    {
      "vehicalId": "61401e63-007b-4b1c-8914-9eb6e9bd95c5",
      "make": "Toyota",
      "model": "Camry",
      "year": 2000,
